msgid "Optional: ``accessibility:<namespace>:priority``"
msgstr "Valfritt: ``accessibility:<namespace>:priority``"

#. USD accessibility namespace and priority values, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:751.
msgid ""
"The ``<namespace>`` may be any valid USD primvar identifier including "
"``default``, which is the recommended namespace to use as a convention. The "
"value of ``priority`` may be one of ``low, standard, high``."
msgstr ""
"``<namespace>`` kan vara en giltig USD-primvar-identifierare, inklusive "
"``default``, som rekommenderas som konvention. Värdet för ``priority`` kan "
"vara ``low``, ``standard`` eller ``high``."

#. USD accessibility recommendation, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:754.
msgid ""
"It is highly encouraged to set the root prim's accessibility fields for any "
"long-lived USD document that might be served to a broad set of software and "
"people. For example, when uploading to an asset marketplace etc."
msgstr ""
"Vi rekommenderar starkt att tillgänglighetsfälten för rotprimet anges i alla "
"långlivade USD-dokument som kan tillhandahållas för många olika program och "
"människor, till exempel vid uppladdning till en tillgångsmarknadsplats."

#. USD accessibility animation limitation, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:760.
msgid ""
"Blender does not support time-varying accessibility schemas since custom "
"String properties are non-animatable."
msgstr ""
"Blender har inte stöd för tidsvarierande tillgänglighetsscheman, eftersom "
"anpassade strängegenskaper inte kan animeras."

#. USDZ texture import advice, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:32.
msgid ""
"When importing a `USDZ archive <https://openusd.org/release/"
"spec_usdz.html>`__, it is important to carefully consider the :ref:`Import "
"Textures <usd-import-textures>` option to determine whether and how to copy "
"texture files from the zip archive."
msgstr ""
"Vid import av ett `USDZ-arkiv <https://openusd.org/release/"
"spec_usdz.html>`__ är det viktigt att noga överväga "
"alternativet :ref:`Import Textures <usd-import-textures>` för att avgöra om "
"och hur texturfiler ska kopieras från ZIP-arkivet."

#. USD Scope primitive description, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:44.
msgid ""
"USD also supports ``Scope`` primitives, which are entities that do not "
"contain transform data, but which serve to group other element of the scene. "
"Blender doesn't have an exact counterpart to the concept of a scope, so such "
"primitives are imported as Blender empties located at the origin. This is an "
"imperfect representation, because empty objects have a transform and "
"``Scopes`` do not, but this approach nonetheless helps preserve the "
"structure of the scene hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"USD stöder även ``Scope``-primitiver, som är enheter utan transformdata och "
"som används för att gruppera andra scenelement. Blender har ingen direkt "
"motsvarighet till scope-begreppet, så sådana primitiver importeras som tomma "
"Blender-objekt vid origo. Det är en ofullständig representation, eftersom "
"tomma objekt har en transform och ``Scope``-primitiver inte har det, men "
"detta bevarar ändå scenhierarkins struktur."

